{
 "section_summary": "These pages contain Japanese overseas broadcasting magazines for February and January 1941, with schedules, cultural articles, and accounts of exhibitions and performances. A U.S. Embassy report between the issues notes that Japan broadcast to nearly every world region in sixteen languages. Several articles present Japan’s war in China and its proposed regional order in favorable terms.",
